   "text": "Webster University in Vienna, Austria - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWebster University in Vienna, Austria\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWVPU is one of the longest operating private universities in Austria. Established upon the invitation of Vienna’s mayor, Dr. Leopold Gratz, it became the first university in the country to offer degree programs entirely in English, the first to offer an accredited MBA degree in 1985, and one of the first to receive full accreditation as a private university in 2001.&nbsp;\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n28/07/2026 11:15\nby Gunia Beniwal\nCreated\n16/05/2022 10:12\nby Data Migration\nType\nUniversity\nCountry\nAustria\nYearly Fees\nMax: €25,004.35\nMin: €12,502.17\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n20%\n100 of 500 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPrivate\nProvider\nDirect QS\nFounded Year\n1981\nCampus(es)\nVienna\nCountry\nAustria\nExcluded Countries\nNA\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n10/04/2026\nContract End Date\n09/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\nScholarship available\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xje5JivI_4M\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
